# Revint (`revint`) — project map

B2B SaaS for agency lead generation. Stack: **Next.js 16.2.3 (App Router, Webpack), React 19, TypeScript, Prisma 6 + Postgres + pgvector, Supabase auth, BullMQ + Redis (ioredis), Gemini (`@google/generative-ai`), Stripe v22, Tailwind v4, Radix UI, Framer Motion, Resend, Apify, Playwright.**

## Folder map (only what agents need)

```
src/
  app/
    (marketing)/      ← public marketing site
    (public)/         ← SEO-indexable directory pages, /m/<slug> mockups
    app/              ← authed product (dashboard, leads, deals, copilot, settings)
    api/              ← all REST routes; every authed route uses `requireUser()`
    auth/             ← Supabase auth pages
